@startuml InternSafar_SA_Employer_Approvals_vs_Manual
title InternSafar - Employer registration → SuperAdmin Approvals\n(proven live path 2026-09-23)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #334155
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #64748B
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam activityFontSize 12
skinparam titleFontSize 14

start

note right
  Live proof (register via UI API with
  manualRequest=false):
  Domain + Free-email BOTH create
  ip_users + ip_employers (pending)
  and appear on /superadmin/approvals.
  Neither writes ip_employer_requests.
  Form Registrations + Manual Requests
  UI queues are retired (redirect).
end note

:Employer opens /register/employer;
:Chooses Domain-based OR Free-email-based;
:POST /api/ip/auth/register-employer\n(manualRequest=false, path=domain|free_email);
:CREATE ip_users (employer)\nregistration_source = domain | free_email;
:CREATE ip_employers\napproval_status = pending;
:Send email verify link;
:Notify SuperAdmin -> /superadmin/approvals;

:Appears on /superadmin/approvals\nPath column: Domain | Free Email;

  if (SuperAdmin decision?) then (Approve)
    if (Documents ready?\n>=1 approved and 0 pending) then (yes)
      :Set approval_status = approved;
      :Employer can post\n(if email verified);
    else (no)
      :BLOCK Final Approval;\nEmployer uploads under Profile and docs;\nSA approves on Documents first;\nSee employer-final-approval-documents-first.puml;
    endif
  else (Reject / Delete)
    :Reject or deactivate account;
  endif

note right
  Legacy manualRequest=true still
  inserts ip_employer_requests only
  (no live UI path). Do not restore
  a second SuperAdmin queue for it.
end note

stop

@enduml
